From: Hapile Manyeli <sliqman42@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 10:37:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] Fix the clang-tidy and complexity findings that matter

Checked access to optional values in the demo loader and the audit export,
checked downcast to HeadOfDepartment, initialised maxMark, made the column
lists const, explicit constructor, and split every function above a
cyclomatic complexity of 10. The menus are now tables of small actions.
No change to what the program does. Evidence is in docs/week6/evidence.

